otics and other medicines in primary care: a cross-sectional study. Br J General Pract. 2019;69:e42&#x2013;e51. doi: 10.3399/bjgp18X700457.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType=\"doi\">10.3399/bjgp18X700457</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType=\"pmc\">PMC6301355</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType=\"pubmed\">30559110</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference></ReferenceList></PubmedData></PubmedArticle></PubmedArticleSet>"